[0056] FIG. 4 a table illustrating the last transform stage employing scalar optimization;
[0057] FIG. 5 a table illustrating the last transform stage employing a vectorization;
[0058] FIG. 6 a table illustrating the last transform stage employing a vectorization and sorting;
[0059] FIG. 7 an illustration showing sequential SIMD loads to enhance reading performance;
[0060] FIG. 8 an illustration showing 4x4 vectorized transpose to build required vectors for the last transformation stage;
